sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CSMS->>CS: TriggerMessageRequest (requestedMessage = FirmwareStatusNotification)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: requestedMessage must be FirmwareStatusNotification
    CS-->>CSMS: TriggerMessageResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Idle)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse
